  "body": "Auction day is firmly on the agenda, and all genuine interest is welcomed. \r\nDiscover the ultimate family lifestyle in one of Browns Bay’s most desirable cul-de-sacs. Positioned proudly at the end of Malters Place, this substantial six-bedroom, three-bathroom residence delivers exceptional space, privacy, and comfort across an impressive 344sqm floor plan. Crafted in solid brick and weatherboard, thoughtfully designed for modern living, it’s a home that effortlessly meets the needs of large families, multi-generational living, or those seeking room to grow without compromise.\r\nMultiple living zones create flexibility for busy households, while the generous open plan kitchen and dining area form the social heart of the home. Step outside to sun-soaked entertaining spaces, ideal for weekend gatherings and relaxed evenings.\r\nFamilies will appreciate the outstanding school zoning, including the highly sought after Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and Pinehill School — a major drawcard for buyers seeking long term educational value.\r\nBrowns Bay itself offers an unbeatable coastal lifestyle. Enjoy vibrant cafés, restaurants, boutique shopping, and the golden sands of Browns Bay Beach just minutes away. Albany’s retail and transport hub is close by, providing convenience without sacrificing the relaxed East Coast Bays atmosphere. Parks, reserves, sports facilities, and walking tracks are all within easy reach, making this a location where lifestyle truly comes first.\r\nHomes of this scale, quality, and position are rarely available. With its combination of space, construction integrity, school zoning, and coastal convenience, this exceptional property represents an outstanding opportunity for buyers seeking a premium family home in one of the North Shore’s most loved suburbs.\r\nBuyers seeking exceptional value in a premium East Coast Bays location are strongly encouraged to inspect early and undertake their due diligence without delay.\r\nLarge family homes in this location are always sought after. With motivated vendors and a clear pathway to sale, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\nYour next chapter begins at 35 Malters Place — a home where every day feels effortless.",
